<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent land-dispute clashes have killed dozens in Niger state and Plateau, while gunmen attacked a Delta NDC rally, prompting IPAC warnings ahead of the 2027 elections. In Zamfara, a road accident killed APC members and the party suspended a campaign rally, and Omo-Agege reported a deadly attack that led the Delta government to impose a curfew on the local government area. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/nigeria/missed-opportunity-fuel-cost-emissions-savings-case-study-maiduguri-nigeria&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/nigeria/lessons-learned-ride-sharing-maiduguri-nigeria&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQVDBmSUxialI1NWZQWXVLUFhZUW5rUG1IYXNMWnVSOWU5SUdibVRaWi0yOXJYZWFUYzAtT2Q3a3F3S3JtS2FEN2hWS2dKRVBEN1pQazh0N21wXzFqcFRHMUREWEs4ZjBpWDF0TDVvQTRiSGotd2lPNHZFY2ZYQ084YkhFbUg5M0FNUVUxV0tBOUlCa01CdlRuWXJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pulse Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOZVk1QWdKems5aEs4WGhxa1JxaG9XZ1l2WVFmeWI2SnpfYlQ1MUdpTmVlSkRZZWJ3TVluUVdON2V3TEVEeGl6Wkh1UVlBUmc4UzdmcWY1aGJYMy1hWWNJaUxEcy1MUHpFQVN4c1Fqa3NjVFdVY1BQR1hPUEktbE9CWnpfNTN2VGdMT3ZpeTlzZGpBRUhZQVNNSWxIS2pzdzQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Independent&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Killeen Daily Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQQnRON2hhZXpZR0F3SlJTSVYtcFNyX3dfR2g1MXFpUC11U255Um1LVHR0RWEwbUM0MmZ0TFhoLTd5MElGLWtDQnlrWFVBZW42YTBUVzF0QzVwQnJiOThfWlkzVjBfU1dGRnJlZGNPamdtNkZZbEJzTm5EVU9jcjZjQUlhazg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot